#: config/chroot_local-includes/usr/local/bin/electrum:62
msgid ""
"Tails needs donations to keep everybody free and safe online.\n"
"\n"
"Every bit helps in our fight against surveillance and censorship!\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Tails potrebuje dary, aby udržal všetkých slobodných a bezpečných online.\n"
"\n"
"Každý príspevok pomáha v našom boji proti sledovaniu a cenzúre!\n"
"\n"

#: config/chroot_local-includes/usr/local/bin/electrum:72
msgid ""
"Tails protects your wallet.\n"
"\n"
"Help us keep your bitcoins safe!\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Tails chráni vašu peňaženku.\n"
"\n"
"Pomôžte nám udržať vaše bitcoiny v bezpečí!\n"
"\n"

#: config/chroot_local-includes/usr/local/bin/electrum:140
msgid "Donate Now"
msgstr "Darovať teraz"

#: config/chroot_local-includes/usr/local/bin/electrum:142
msgid "Later"
msgstr "Neskôr"

#: config/chroot_local-includes/usr/local/bin/electrum:156
msgid "Opening Electrum with our donation address..."
msgstr "Otvára sa Electrum s našou adresou pre dary..."

#: config/chroot_local-includes/usr/local/bin/electrum:157
msgid "Thank you for making the Internet a safer place!"
msgstr "Ďakujeme, že robíte internet bezpečnejším miestom!"

#: config/chroot_local-includes/usr/local/bin/electrum:191
msgid "Persistence is disabled for Electrum"
msgstr "Trvalosť je pre Electrum vypnutá"

#: config/chroot_local-includes/usr/local/bin/electrum:193
msgid ""
"When you reboot Tails, all of Electrum's data will be lost, including your "
"Bitcoin wallet.\n"
"It is strongly recommended to only run Electrum when its persistence feature "
"is activated."
msgstr ""
"Ak reštartujete Tails, všetky dáta z programu Electrum budú stratené, "
"vrátane vašej Bitcoin peňaženky.\n"
"Dôrazne sa odporúča spúštať Electrum iba ak je aktivovaná funkcia trvalého "
"oddielu."

#: config/chroot_local-includes/usr/local/bin/electrum:195
msgid "Do you want to start Electrum anyway?"
msgstr "Chcete aj tak spustiť Electrum?"

#: config/chroot_local-includes/usr/local/bin/electrum:201
msgid "_Launch"
msgstr "_Spustiť"

#: config/chroot_local-includes/usr/local/bin/electrum:202
msgid "_Exit"
msgstr "_Ukončiť"

