"Errors were detected in the file system of your Persistent Storage.\n"
"\n"
"Tails can try to fix these errors, but this might erase some of your data "
"and take a long time.\n"
"\n"
"If you already have an up-to-date backup of your Persistent Storage, we "
"recommend that you try to repair.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't have a backup, we recommend that you create a partition image "
"of your Persistent Storage first."
msgstr ""
"Vo vašom trvalom úložisku boli zistené chyby v súborovom systéme.\n"
"\n"
